From d36f55a202379e21cc34eecd34b390da9a21bfa1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: plotarmordev <299844489+plotarmordev@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 20:52:07 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 39/39] drama: a synthesis that stays silent for 10 s ends
 there with finish reason silence

The native model can stall in digital silence mid-reply. One stall lasted 7.4 s and recovered; two never recovered (37 s and 64 s) and padded the reply until end of speech or the frame cap. A 10 s silent run now ends the synthesis, keeps the audio and reports X-Finish-Reason: silence, for single replies, streams and every long-form segment.
